{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd9cMawkey The Last Macaw is a 2D pixel art adventure in which we control Mawkey, trying to prevent the destruction of the environment and the mistreatment of animals in Honduras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/d10595b938898766b0743f04d618a11c.poster.avif?t=1754146559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/d10595b938898766b0743f04d618a11c.webm?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/d10595b938898766b0743f04d618a11c.mp4?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deforestation and fires caused by the evil businessman Adreim lead to the extinction of all the scarlet macaws in Honduras, leaving Mawkey alone on his journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/41c4c0c435a8f9fea7ffa3cf86d7913b.poster.avif?t=1754146559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/41c4c0c435a8f9fea7ffa3cf86d7913b.webm?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/41c4c0c435a8f9fea7ffa3cf86d7913b.mp4?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>This game is inspired by games like: Rayman, Donkey Kong and Mario Bros.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/38549244ff1bf0eb77d63386de770db1.poster.avif?t=1754146559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/38549244ff1bf0eb77d63386de770db1.webm?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/38549244ff1bf0eb77d63386de770db1.mp4?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>We will have a total of 5 Bosses throughout the game, making it a somewhat challenging game for those casual players looking for a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/ea84c1361c3bf138b66d56b1afb3344d.poster.avif?t=1754146559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/ea84c1361c3bf138b66d56b1afb3344d.webm?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/ea84c1361c3bf138b66d56b1afb3344d.mp4?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game reflects what is happening in the world today, something that we humans do not see and do not want to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mawkey\u2019s Allies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout his journey, Mawkey will meet five animals who will help him pass various levels. Their names are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colimbus: The Emerald Hummingbird. He will help you by revealing the hidden cages where hunters have captured several exotic Honduran parrots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trukki: The strongest toucan in his family. He can hold Mawkey to prevent him from falling into the void between the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Xerothillo: This little friend helps you shrink to fit into small spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flyo: A dove with a lot of flow that will allow you to run at incredible speeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mowsy: The white bat in charge of guiding you with his echolocation through extremely dark caves where nothing can be seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/9cacdf6d0250959540f7a698a9c90bfc.poster.avif?t=1754146559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/9cacdf6d0250959540f7a698a9c90bfc.webm?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/9cacdf6d0250959540f7a698a9c90bfc.mp4?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please support this project by adding it to your wishlist.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921580?t=1754146559","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/9c7dd0e4e43928d2bd721f9bbdfff9890b1e2cb0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754146559","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/b94b773dca82d627b9524e3bf30a3146ed34ecd3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754146559","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/b94b773dca82d627b9524e3bf30a3146ed34ecd3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754146559","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd9cMawkey The Last Macaw is a 2D pixel art adventure in which we control Mawkey, trying to prevent the destruction of the environment and the mistreatment of animals in Honduras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/d10595b938898766b0743f04d618a11c.poster.avif?t=1754146559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/d10595b938898766b0743f04d618a11c.webm?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/d10595b938898766b0743f04d618a11c.mp4?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deforestation and fires caused by the evil businessman Adreim lead to the extinction of all the scarlet macaws in Honduras, leaving Mawkey alone on his journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/41c4c0c435a8f9fea7ffa3cf86d7913b.poster.avif?t=1754146559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/41c4c0c435a8f9fea7ffa3cf86d7913b.webm?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/41c4c0c435a8f9fea7ffa3cf86d7913b.mp4?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>This game is inspired by games like: Rayman, Donkey Kong and Mario Bros.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/38549244ff1bf0eb77d63386de770db1.poster.avif?t=1754146559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/38549244ff1bf0eb77d63386de770db1.webm?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/38549244ff1bf0eb77d63386de770db1.mp4?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>We will have a total of 5 Bosses throughout the game, making it a somewhat challenging game for those casual players looking for a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/ea84c1361c3bf138b66d56b1afb3344d.poster.avif?t=1754146559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/ea84c1361c3bf138b66d56b1afb3344d.webm?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/ea84c1361c3bf138b66d56b1afb3344d.mp4?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game reflects what is happening in the world today, something that we humans do not see and do not want to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mawkey\u2019s Allies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout his journey, Mawkey will meet five animals who will help him pass various levels. Their names are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colimbus: The Emerald Hummingbird. He will help you by revealing the hidden cages where hunters have captured several exotic Honduran parrots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trukki: The strongest toucan in his family. He can hold Mawkey to prevent him from falling into the void between the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Xerothillo: This little friend helps you shrink to fit into small spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flyo: A dove with a lot of flow that will allow you to run at incredible speeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mowsy: The white bat in charge of guiding you with his echolocation through extremely dark caves where nothing can be seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/9cacdf6d0250959540f7a698a9c90bfc.poster.avif?t=1754146559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/9cacdf6d0250959540f7a698a9c90bfc.webm?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/9cacdf6d0250959540f7a698a9c90bfc.mp4?t=1754146559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please support this project by adding it to your wishlist.</p>","developers":["Guerra Pixel Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/b48e420b42b2fc03d24f73c8f4129fcf186fd32f/header.jpg?t=1754146559","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Mawkey The Last Macaw \u00a9 2025 Eduardo Manrrique Duron Guerra. All rights reserved.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\"Mawkey\" and \"Guerra Pixel Studio\" are trademarks of Eduardo Manrrique Duron Guerra.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeveloped with GameMaker Studio 2.<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257176355,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176355/movie480.mp4?t=1754105193","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176355/movie_max.mp4?t=1754105193"},"name":"Mawkey Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176355/8309037ad4299f90bb76b894d5879f4839499eec/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754105193","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176355/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754105193","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176355/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754105193"}}],"name":"Mawkey The Last Macaw","package_groups":[],"pc_requirem